Getcostsheet](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/common-icons-hb.png)Get Cost Sheet\n\n## Lodha MarquisePhotos & Videos\n\n![Video Thumbnail](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/gallery/video-thumbnail.webp)\n\n## About Lodha Marquise\n\nLodha Marquise is a soaring tower inside the vast residential complex of Lodha The Park. Its 2, 3, and 4 BHK air-conditioned flats are spacious in design and equipped with designer marble floors & bath fittings. The property is designed by Woha, a Singaporean architecture firm and includes fabulous amenities such as a private theatre, cafe, library, luxury spa, outdoor gym, & business centre. A fruit orchard, butterfly park, & picnic trail further add serenity to Lodha Marquise. Based at Lower Parel, the property features reputed schools, colleges, healthcare, and malls in its vicinity. These include iconic landmarks such as Siddhivinayak Temple, IKEA, KEM Hospital, & Pho…Read More\n\n## Lodha Marquise Amenities\n\nClub house\n\nConference Room\n\nJogging Track\n\nSports Courts\n\nKids Play Area\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nJacuzzi\n\nYoga Zone\n\nGym\n\nParty Lawn\n\nPet Park\n\nAmphitheater\n\nMini-Theater\n\nLibrary\n\nOpen Gym\n\n## Lodha Marquise Facilities\n\nIntercom\n\nLift\n\nGas Pipeline\n\nPower Back Up\n\nWater Harvest\n\nParking\n\nSecurity System\n\n## Specifications\n\n### Floor\n\nLiving/Dining/BedroomVitrified Tiles\n\nKitchenVitrified Tiles\n\nBathroomAnti Skid Tiles\n\n### Fitting\n\nBathroomPremium Quality Sanitary Wares & C.P. Fittings\n\nElectricalConcealed Wiring with Elegant Modular Switches\n\nWindowsAluminum Windows with Sliding Shutter\n\n### Wall & Ceilling\n\nStructureRCC Framed Structure\n\nPaintingOil Bound Distemper\n\nWalls & CeilingPOP/Gypsum Finish\n\n![down-brouchure](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/down-brouchure-file.svg)\n\n## View Brochure of Lodha Marquise\n\nExplore complete project insights, layouts,  \n specifications, and more.\n\nView Brochure![View Brochure](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/common-icons-hb.png)\n\n## Rating of Lodha Marquise\n\n4.5\n\n★★★★★★★★★★\n\n(4Reviews)\n\n5Amenity\n\n4Construction\n\n4Green Area\n\n5Connectivity\n\nSort By\n\n5\n\n★★\n\n#### Positive\n\nI would recommend buying a flat at Lodha Marquise if you’re looking for a posh complex in a good neighbourhood in Sobo. We absolutely liked the location of the project.\n\n5\n\n★★\n\n#### Positive\n\nOverall, I like the project as it is based in a prime business location, the flats on offer are spacious, and it is offering many amenities.\n\n### About Builder - Lodha Group\n\n★★★★★★★★★★\n\nEstablished In -1980Total Projects - 159\n\n[View Details](builders/lodha-group)\n\n* **Lodha Group was founded in 1980** by Mangal Prabhat Lodha. With a total experience of 46 years, Lodha is known for developing luxurious, life-integrated developments with a strong focus on sustainability.\n* Lodha has delivered **246+ projects, over 112 million sq. ft. of development, and 60,000+ homes**. Some of Lodha’s iconic developments include Lodha Palava, Altamount, Malabar, World Towers, and Lodha Park.\n* Today, Lodha has **132 million square feet of land under construction across 40+ ongoing projects**, making it one of the largest real estate developers in India.\n\n#### Highlights of Lodha Group\n\n* **With 46+ years of experience**, Lodha has become one of the top developers in India, known for delivering residential, commercial, and township developments across India and London.\n* Lodha’s projects are known for their **premium construction quality,** incorporating advanced engineering, high-quality material sourcing, and dual-team quality control.\n* **Integrated lifestyle developments** are one of the biggest differentiators of Lodha, combining education, fitness, and retail all within one single township.\n* Its **strong delivery track record** includes the successful delivery of 246+ projects, over 112 million sq. ft. of development, and 60,000+ homes.\n* Lodha has established a **strong pan-India and international presence**, delivering projects in Mumbai, Thane, Pune, Bangalore, Hyderabad, Delhi NCR, and London.\n* The company has established a **strong brand reputation** through creating lavish residential developments that combine modern design, quality construction, and full-fledged lifestyles.\n\nFAQs about Lodha Marquise\n\n## Questions & Answers aboutLodha Marquise\n\nQ.\n\n### Are there good hospitals near Lodha Marquise?\n\nYes, Tata Memorial Hospital & KEM Hospital are close to Lodha Marquise\n\nQ.\n\n### Is Lower Parel Station near the project?\n\nYes, Lower Parel station is within 5 to 10 minutes of Lodha Marquise\n\nQ.\n\n### Are there areas for senior citizens to relax at Lodha Marquise?\n\nYes, the property offers amenities such as reflexology park, peaceful gardens, and a serene Ganesh temple for senior citizens.\n\nQ.\n\n### Is the project pet friendly?\n\nYes, Lodha Marquise is pet friendly and features a pet garden and walk\n\nQ.\n\n### Does Lodha Marquise offer a gym?\n\nYes, the project features the famous Evander Holyfield gym along with an outdoor one.\n\nDisclaimer: While Homebazaar.com takes all steps to ensure accuracy of the information provided in this section, please check the same with the developers. Homebazaar.com does not take responsibility for any discrepancies in the information provided.\n\n### Price Insights of Worli\n\n### Here are some key pointers based on the graph:\n\n**1.Location :**  The graph represents property price insights for Pandurang Budhkar Marg, Worli.\n\n**2.Timeframe :**  The data covers the years 2016 and 2026.\n\n**3.Price per sqft :** \n\n2016: ₹32,300 Sq.ft\n\n2017: ₹40,000 Sq.ft (increase by 23.8%)\n\n2018: ₹41,350 Sq.ft (increase by 3.4%)\n\n2019: ₹38,500 Sq.ft (Decreased by 6.9%)\n\n2020: ₹36,400 Sq.ft (Decreased by 5.5%)\n\n2021: ₹40,400 Sq.ft (increase by 11%)\n\n2022: ₹41,050 Sq.ft (increase by 1.6%)\n\n2023: ₹58,400 Sq.ft (increase by 42.3%)\n\n2024: ₹62,500 Sq.ft (increase by 7%)\n\n2025: ₹63,100 Sq.ft (increase by 1%)\n\n2026: ₹67,517 Sq.ft (increase by 7%)\n\n**4.Trend :**  The property prices in Pandurang Budhkar Marg, Worli increased by 109% over the period 2016 to 2026\n\n#### About Worli, Mumbai\n\nWorli is a residential/commercial hub with luxury real estate, attracting the rich and famous, and blending heritage. Worli’s location is strategic, and it gives seamless connectivity to key corridors and urban infrastructure. It is the ideal location for residents who prioritize luxury and convenience.\n\nThe new Metro Aqua line connects Worli directly to key areas like BKC, Dadar, Chhatrapati International Airport and both South and North Mumbai. People travelling by train can easily get to Lower Parel and Prabhadevi railway stations on the Western Line. Worli also has a network of buses and taxis.\n\nResidents enjoy proximity to retail shops, dining, and shopping centres. It’s close to some cultural and leisure attractions such as Worli Sea Face, Worli Fort, Nehru Planetarium and the iconic Bandra-Worli Sea Link, while reputable hospitals like M.A. Podar Hospital, KEM Hospital, TATA Memorial Hospital, etc. are all within a few minutes of drive.\n\nWorli is the best combination of connectivity, lifestyle amenities, scenic views, and urban infrastructure, which makes it desirable.\n\nRead More About the Locality\n\n#### Similar Projects Nearby in Worli, Mumbai\n\n[![Birla Niyaara](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/6a3d26937d5c1_birla-niyaara-elevation.webp?tr=w-112,h-72)\n\n##### Birla Niyaara\n\nStarting From 4.75 Cr](birla-niyaara-worli-5037)[![Lodha The Park](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/6a4b4b7d15fe5_lodha-the-park-elevation.webp?tr=w-112,h-72)\n\n##### Lodha The Park\n\nStarting From 6.5 Cr](lodha-the-park-worli-269)[![Lodha World Crest](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/6a58b5023edef_lodha-world-crest-elevation.webp?tr=w-112