 an intermediary offering its platform to advertise properties of Seller for a Customer/Buyer/User coming on its Website and is not and cannot be a party to or privy to or control in any manner any transactions between the Seller and the Customer/Buyer/User. All the offers and discounts on this Website have been extended by Read more various Builder(s)/Developer(s) who have advertised their products. Magicbricks is only communicating the offers and not selling or rendering any of those products or services. It neither warrants nor is it making any representations with respect to offer(s) made on the site. Magicbricks Realty Services Limited shall neither be responsible nor liable to mediate or resolve any disputes or disagreements between the Customer/Buyer/User and the Seller and both Seller and Customer/Buyer/User shall settle all such disputes without involving Magicbricks Realty Services Limited in any manner.\n\nAll trademarks, logos and names are properties of their respective owners. All Rights Reserved. © Copyright 2026 Magicbricks Realty Services Limited.","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-marquise/6291/project","title":"Lodha Marquise Worli, Mumbai | 3,4 BHK Flats Price List & RERA Details","raw_content":"# Lodha Marquise Worli, Mumbai\n\n![Lodha developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/lodha-521-6366.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\nLocated in Worli, Mumbai, Lodha Marquise offers a premium residential experience. Developed by Lodha, the property features 2,222 homes designed for modern living. It offers 3, 4 BHK Flats with prices starting from ₹ 8.97 Cr. Residents here will enjoy a range of amenities and a lifestyle enhanced by a connectivity index of 4.1. The development is near KGT International School, Lower Parel, Siddhivinayak Temple, Dahisar East, Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Park, Shivaji Park and enjoys easy access via Eastern Express Highway, Dr Annie Besant Road, N M Joshi Marg. The average asking price in the locality is ₹ 74,050 /Sq.Ft.. With a livability index of 4.1, this location provides an ideal setting for families and individuals alike.\n\n![Lodha Marquise Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-marquise-project-project-large-image1-9668.jpg?aio=w-520;h-260;crop;)\n![Lodha Marquise Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-marquise-amenities-features5.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Lodha Marquise Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-marquise-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹8.97 Cr - 10.48 Cr**\n\n₹51,651 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Lodha Marquise?\n\n## About Lodha Marquise, Worli by Lodha\n\nWelcome to Lodha Marquise, a premium residential development located in Worli, Mumbai, designed to deliver a refined urban lifestyle with excellent connectivity and modern living spaces. Developed by Lodha, this landmark project in Mumbai South offers thoughtfully planned residences with spacious layouts, elegant interiors, and seamless access to major business hubs, social infrastructure, and everyday conveniences. Strategically positioned at Worli Mumbai, Lodha Marquise combines contemporary architecture, lifestyle-focused planning, and strong investment potential, making it an ideal choice for homebuyers and investors seeking comfort, connectivity, and long-term value in one of Mumbai’s most sought-after locations.\n\n## Lodha Marquise Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\nHomes at Lodha Marquise are priced from ₹ 8.97 Cr up to ₹ 10.48 Cr, offering a range of options to suit different budgets. The 3 BHK: ₹ 8.97 Cr, 4 BHK: ₹ 10.11 Cr provide a detailed breakdown of costs for various configurations. These apartments offer exceptional value, considering the average asking price of ₹ 74,050 /Sq.Ft. in Worli\n\nThe pricing structure reflects the quality and amenities available. Consider the value, given the average rental price of ₹ 240 /Sq.Ft.\n\nWith 4 different configurations, there is pricing available for 3 BHK Apartment at ₹ 8.97 Cr with area of 1297 Sq. Ft. and 3 BHK Apartment at ₹ 9.32 Cr with area of 1347 Sq. Ft.. The ₹ 51,651 Per Sq. Ft. provides further insight into the cost per square foot.\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Lodha Marquise.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1297 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 8.97 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1347 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 9.32 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1471 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 10.11 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1525 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 10.48 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nLodha Marquise's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Worli.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Lodha Marquise | Worli |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 71600 | 66300 |\n| Mar 2026 | 71450 | 74050 |\n| Dec 2025 | 58800 | 70800 |\n| Sep 2025 | 62000 | 65700 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nLodha Marquise avg. price is ₹ 71.6 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Worli at ₹ 66.3 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| Current Project **Lodha Marquise** | ₹ 71,600 |\n| Worli | ₹ 66,300 |\n| [Lodha Parkside](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-parkside/6293/project \"Lodha Parkside\") | ₹ 64,250 |\n| [Lodha The Park Side](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-the-park-side/27863/project \"Lodha The Park Side\") | ₹ 63,600 |\n| [Lodha The Park](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-the-park/27816/project \"Lodha The Park\") | ₹ 63,450 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Lodha Marquise ranges from ₹ 3.5 L to ₹ 4.4 L with options available for 3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Lodha Marquise | In Worli |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 70 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 1.9 L |\n| 3 BHK | ₹ 3.5 L | ₹ 3.8 L |\n| 4 BHK | ₹ 4.4 L | ₹ 5.2 L |\n| 5 BHK | - | ₹ 8.7 L |\n| 6 BHK | - | ₹ 9.6 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Lodha Marquise.\n\n#### 27 Underground Parking Facilities to Combat Mumbai's Parking Crisis\n\nMumbai is set to develop 27 underground parking facilities, one in each administrative ward, to alleviate the severe parking shortage. This project, backed by the BMC Budget 2026-27, will create parking beneath existing gardens and playgrounds, reducing roadside parking and traffic congestion.\n\n#### New Road Link Approved to Enhance Mumbai Connectivity\n\nThe Maharashtra government has approved a ₹1,722 crore road link project aimed at connecting the Versova-Bandra Sea Link with the Mumbai Coastal Road. This infrastructure development is expected to significantly improve traffic flow, reduce commuting times across the city.\n\nRent in Lodha Marquise ranges from ₹ 4 L to ₹ 4 L with options available for 3 BHK, 4 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Lodha Marquise moved from ₹ 71,450/sqft to ₹ 71,600/sqft, reflecting a 0.21% rise.\n\n#### Mumbai to Establish Four New Helipads for Emergency Services\n\nMumbai authorities are planning to construct four new helipads within the next six years to enhance emergency response capabilities. Two helipads will be built along the Coastal Road, one at Worli and another in Kandivali's Charkop area. The remaining two will be developed in the Bandra Kurla Complex (BKC).\n\n#### Elphinstone Road Overbridge Dismantled for Infrastructure Upgrade\n\nMumbai's historic Elphinstone Road Overbridge, a 113-year-old British-era structure, has been dismantled. This move is part of infrastructure upgrades aimed at improving rail operations and commuter safety. The dismantling creates space for two additional suburban lines between Kurla and Parel, which will eventually extend to CSMT. A new double-decker ROB will replace the old structure.\n\n#### Versova Property Market Poised for Growth Driven by Sea Link and Redevelopment\n\nThe Versova property market is experiencing a surge in demand and property prices, fueled by the upcoming Versova-Bandra Sea Link and ongoing redevelopment projects. This infrastructure development is expected to sustain property values and attract significant buyer interest in the coming years.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Lodha Marquise moved from ₹ 58,800/sqft to ₹ 71,450/sqft, reflecting a 21.51% rise.\n\n#### Mumbai Infrastructure Projects Gain Momentum with Budget Allocations and Project Launches\n\nMumbai is experiencing a surge in infrastructure and activity. The BMC has proposed a record budget of ₹80,952.56 crore for FY 2026-27, with a significant portion allocated to infrastructure projects like the Coastal Road, Goregaon-Mulund Link Road (GMLR), and Sewage Treatment Plants (STPs).MMRDA has allocated over ₹5,400 crore for road tunnel projects, including one connecting Worli-Bandra Sea Link to Mumbai Airport.\n\n#### BMC Outlines Timelines for Key Infrastructure Projects\n\nThe BMC has set completion targets for key infrastructure projects: the Bandra (E)-Kalanagar skywalk (almost complete) , the first phase of the Bandra-Dharavi flyover reconstruction (Mithi river widening project ,near completion) , and the Worli connector by December 2026. These projects are expected to improve pedestrian access, ease traffic congestion, and enhance overall connectivity within the city.\n\n## Lodha Marquise Floor Plans\n\nHomes at Lodha Marquise are priced from ₹ 8.97 Cr up to ₹ 10.48 Cr, offering a range of options to suit different budgets. The 3 BHK: ₹ 8.97 Cr, 4 BHK: ₹ 10.11 Cr provide a detailed breakdown of costs for various configurations. These apartments offer exceptional value, considering the average asking price of ₹ 74,050 /Sq.Ft. in Worli\n\nThe pricing structure reflects the quality and amenities available. Consider the value, given the average rental price of ₹ 240 /Sq.Ft.\n\nWith 4 different configurations, there is pricing available for 3 BHK Apartment at ₹ 8.97 Cr with area of 1297 Sq. Ft. and 3 BHK Apartment at ₹ 9.32 Cr with area of 1347 Sq. Ft.. The ₹ 51,651 Per Sq. Ft. provides further insight into the cost per square foot.\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1297 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Lodha Marquise, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/lodha-marquise-apartment-3bhk-1297sqft-1-3d-9540.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 3 BHK 1297 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 8.97 Cr**\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1347 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Lodha Marquise, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/lodha-marquise-apartment-3bhk-1347sqft-1-3d-2187.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 3 BHK 1347 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 9.32 Cr**\n\n![Floor plan of 4 BHK 1471 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Lodha Marquise, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/lodha-marquise-apartment-4bhk-1471sqft-1-3d-6702.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 4 BHK 1471 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 10.11 Cr**\n\n![Floor plan of 4 BHK 1525 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Lodha Marquise, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/lodha-marquise-apartment-4bhk-1525sqft-1-3d-9837.jpg?aio=w-278;h-200;crop;)\n\n### 4 BHK 1525 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 10.48 Cr**\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Lodha Marquise\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Lodha Marquise, Mumbai.\n\n![3 BHK + Pooja Room,Servant Room Apartment For Sale in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK Apartment For Sale in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![BHAIRAV PROPERTY  profile picture]()\n![4 BHK Apartment For Sale in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK Apartment For Sale in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Santosh Mahadev Gawade  profile picture]()\n![4 BHK Apartment For Sale in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Dhruv Sunil Parekh  profile picture]()\n![4 BHK +Apartment For Sale in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Rent in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Rent in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Dhruv Sunil Parekh  profile picture]()\n![3 BHK Apartment For Rent in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Santosh Mahadev Gawade  profile picture]()\n![3 BHK + Study Room,Extra Room Apartment For Rent in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK + Servant Room,Study Room Apartment For Rent in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK + Store Room Apartment For Rent in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK + Pooja Room,Servant Room Apartment For Rent in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK Apartment For Rent in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Santosh Mahadev Gawade  profile picture]()\n![4 BHK Apartment For Rent in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK + Servant Room,Study Room Apartment For Rent in Lodha Marquise in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Dhruv Sunil Parekh]()\n\n360 Mumbai Inc\n\n![Amol Uttam Sawant]()\n\nAmol Real Estate\n\n![Manish Rishipal]()\n\nNexus Real Estate\n\nRealtor\n\nMumbai\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Lodha Marquise\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Lodha Marquise to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Lodha Marquise Master Plan 1](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-marquise-project-master-plan-image1.jpg?aio=w-370;h-366;crop;)\n![Lodha Marquise Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-marquise-amenities-features5.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Lodha Marquise Clubhouse External Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-marquise-clubhouse-external-image6.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Lodha Marquise Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-marquise-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n### Master Plan 1\n\nThis master plan for Lodha Marquise features six residential towers and a collection of townhouses.\n\nThe plan allocates significant space to residential units, encompassing both multi-story towers and townhouses. Extensive open and green spaces are integrated throughout the development, dedicated to various amenities and recreational activities. Additionally, there are designated retail spaces located at ground level, offering convenience to residents.\n\nDownload brochure, master plan & walkthrough video of Lodha Marquise to explore floor plans, layout, and complete project details in Worli, Mumbai.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Expert Review\n\n![Refined living at Lodha Marquise.\n3BHK | 4Baths | Upper Worli | For Rent](https://img.squareyards.com/proptv/thumbnails/917cae4f7f1a42a355cebbf13.png?aio=w-212;h-375;crop;)\n![Lodha Marquise](https://img.squareyards.com/proptv/thumbnails/1000031744_5621.png?aio=w-212;h-375;crop;)\n![Lodha Marquise The Park Worli Mumbai Price List Floor Plan Location Map Site Layout Review](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MJhJRJh3zyY/hqdefault.jpg)\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Lodha Marquise\n\nLodha Marquise offers a vibrant community lifestyle with a wide range of amenities including Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Mini Theatre, Reading Room/Library, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant. Residents can enjoy a refreshing swim or workout in the fitness center. This development promotes a healthy and active lifestyle for all age groups.\n\nThese features enhance the living experience. This project provides ample opportunities for recreation and relaxation. It is designed to cater to the diverse needs of modern families and individuals.\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-minithea-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-rainwate-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Lodha Worli\n\nLodha Marquise is situated in Worli, Mumbai, offering a well-connected residential environment. The locality benefits from a connectivity index of 4.1, ensuring ease of travel. Key landmarks such as KGT International School, Lower Parel, Siddhivinayak Temple, Dahisar East, Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Park, Shivaji Park are easily accessible from here.\n\nEastern Express Highway, Dr Annie Besant Road, N M Joshi Marg provide seamless connectivity to other parts of the city. The area is further enhanced by its proximity to KGT International School, Medifit Medical Academy Mumbai HO Medifit Biologicals Limited, Central Railway Employees High School And Junior College, Maratha High School, Prabhadevi Municipal Primary School and Axis Bank Ltd Corporate Office, Standard Chartered Bank, Corporation Bank, Kotak Mahindra Bank, Hdfc Bank Ltd Corporate And Head Office, making it ideal for families and professionals alike. The project's Residential further adds to its appeal. This location is a promising residential destination. The micromarket is Mumbai South.\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai South](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Lodha Marquise.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Lodha Marquise](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-marquise-project-project-large-image1-9668.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Kgt International School\n\n#### Deepak Cinema\n\n#### Senapati Bapat Marg Municipal Dispensary Holly Cross\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Worli\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nThe locality has good accessibility to many modes of transport like bus, train, auto, cab, etc.\n\nTraffic congestion during peak hours is a cause of concern for daily commuters\n\nNice\n\n— Vishal Roy, Real estate agent\n\n## RERA Details of Lodha Marquise\n\nLodha Marquise is currently Ready to Move, ensuring a smooth transition for future residents. This development is designed with modern families in mind, offering a secure and compliant living environment. Further demonstrating commitment to transparency and legal compliance, it is fully RERA registered. The focus remains on timely delivery and adherence to the highest construction standards, promising a valuable investment and a comfortable lifestyle for all homeowners.\n\n## How does Lodha Marquise compare with similar projects?\n\n![Lodha Marquise project in Worli, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-marquise-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Lodha Marquise](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-marquise/6291/project \"Lodha Marquise\")\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Raheja Imperia project in Worli, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-raheja-imperia-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Raheja Imperia](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/raheja-imperia/3312/project \"Raheja Imperia\")\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Lodha Parkside project in Worli, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-parkside-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Lodha Parkside](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-parkside/6293/project \"Lodha Parkside\")\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Lodha Marquise Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Lodha Marquise located at Worli Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nOwner\n\nThe location is great. The appreciation of this project and the high-end lifestyle it provides are lovely.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nI strongly suggest Lodha Marquise to clients looking for luxury in Worli. Its architectural landmark and world-class amenities give it a unique investment opportunity.\n\nOwner\n\nEven with the luxury, I have had to deal with delayed maintenance responses, which is frustrating for me.\n\nOwner\n\nHaving a 3 BHK here has been a pleasure. The Vastu-friendly layout and high-end finishes make for a balanced living environment.\n\nTenant\n\nAlthough the apartment is large, I feel the maintenance charges are really high.\n\n## Lodha Track Record\n\n![Lodha logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/lodha-521-6366.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nLodha Marquise is brought to you by Lodha. The developer brings 39 years of experience to the residential sector, marked by 412 completed projects. This company focuses on creating spaces that resonate with families and individuals alike.\n\nThey are committed to quality construction and timely delivery. This builder's approach emphasizes customer satisfaction, ensuring that each home is built to the highest standards. The developer aims to create sustainable communities, incorporating modern amenities and green spaces. Their dedication to innovation and excellence makes them a trusted name in the real estate industry.\n\n![Lodha Aureus residential project in Sewri](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-aureus-project-flagship-opt-b1aedb56-f1d6-486e-8260-653863e822cc.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSewri, Mumbai\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\n₹ 4.60 Cr to 10.70 Cr\n\n![Lodha Elaris residential project in Vikhroli West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-elaris-project-flagship-opt-a6f5ff23-11cd-42f5-bb1a-134e90c6e093.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVikhroli West, Mumbai\n\n4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 9.00 Cr\n\n![Lodha Worli residential project in Worli](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-worli-project-flagship-opt-bc0b8b13-1b11-4d39-b3eb-487a1ad88d79.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Lodha Sovrano residential project in Jogeshwari West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-sovrano-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nJogeshwari West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.99 Cr to 3.63 Cr\n\n![Lodha Corinthia residential project in Bhandup West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-corinthia-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBhandup West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.35 Cr to 3.20 C