yards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ghp-mars-suncity-project-project-large-image1-7362.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Bliss](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-bliss-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Elixir Reserve](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-elixir-reserve-project-project-large-image1-6960.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![voice search]()\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://soboxpert.com/lodha-marquise-worli","title":"Premium Residences in Lodha Marquise Worli - Sobo Xpert","raw_content":"![Luxury residential real estate project](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/1776339175_lodha_marquise_photos.webp)\n\nPossession December 2020 \n\n# Premium Residences in Lodha Marquise Worli\n\nPremium 3 & 4 BHK luxury homes from from ₹6.69 Cr\\*\n\n## Luxury Living in Worli Heights\n\nLodha Marquise Worli offers premium ready-to-move residences in South Mumbai’s most sought-after address. Spread across 7 acres, this upscale development delivers a refined urban lifestyle. The project features spacious 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments crafted for luxury living. Rising up to G+76 storeys, the tower stands tall with stunning city and sea views. Designed by Lodha Group, the project ensures modern architecture and high-end specifications. With possession ready since December 2020, it is ideal for immediate homebuyers seeking exclusivity.\n\n7.00   Acres Land Parcel\n\nG+76   Storeys Tower\n\n2020   Possession Year\n\n![lodha marquise worli Luxury residential real estate project](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/1776339175_lodha_marquise_photos.webp)\n\n[Enquire Now](#contact)\n\nFloor Plans & Configurations \n\n## The Residences\n\n![Lodha Marquise Smart 3 Bed Floor Plan](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/floor_plans/1776339176_3bhk.jpg)\n\n3 Bed\n\n### Smart 3 Bed\n\nCarpet Area: 1297 - 1347 Sq.ft\n\n₹ 6.69 Cr\\*\n\n View Plan & Price\n\n![Lodha Marquise Elite 4 Bed Floor Plan](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/floor_plans/1776339176_4bhk.png)\n\n4 Bed\n\n### Elite 4 Bed\n\nCarpet Area: 1471 Sq.ft\n\nOn Request\n\n View Plan & Price\n\n![Lodha Marquise Majestic 4 Bed Floor Plan](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/floor_plans/1776339176_5bhk.png)\n\n4 Bed\n\n### Majestic 4 Bed\n\nCarpet Area: 1525 Sq.ft\n\nOn Request\n\n View Plan & Price\n\nWellness & Lifestyle \n\n## Experience World Class Amenities\n\nSwipe to explore amenities →\n\n![lodha marquise worli amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/amenities/1776339176_Zumba___Aerobics.webp)\n\nZumba & Aerobics\n\n![lodha marquise worli amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/amenities/1776339176_Indoor_Games_.webp)\n\nIndoor Games'\n\n![lodha marquise worli amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/amenities/1776339176_Kids_Play_Area.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![lodha marquise worli amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/amenities/1776339176_Sunken_Sit-out_Area.webp)\n\nSunken Sit-out Area\n\n![lodha marquise worli amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/amenities/1776339176_Swimming_Pool.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![lodha marquise worli amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/amenities/1776339176_Podium_Area.webp)\n\nPodium Area\n\nProject Visual Experience \n\n## Project Gallery\n\nExplore premium residential spaces through curated visuals.\n\n![lodha marquise photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/gallery/1776339176_lodha_marquise_photos_6.webp)\n\n![lodha marquise photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/gallery/1776339176_lodha_marquise_photos_5.webp)\n\n![lodha marquise photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/gallery/1776339176_lodha_marquise_photos_4.webp)\n\n![lodha marquise photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/gallery/1776339176_lodha_marquise_photos_3.webp)\n\n![lodha marquise photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/gallery/1776339176_lodha_marquise_photos_2.webp)\n\n![lodha marquise photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/gallery/1776339176_lodha_marquise_photos_1.webp)\n\n![lodha marquise photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/gallery/1776339176_lodha_marquise_photos.webp)\n\nLocation & Connectivity \n\n## Unmatched Connectivity Worli\n\n Strategically located developments offering excellent access.    \n  \n\n* Bombay Dyeing\n\n  10 mins drive\n* 🛍️\n\n  IKEA Worli City Store\n\n  350 meters\n* 🏖️\n\n  Breach Candy\n\n  17 mins drive\n* 🛒\n\n  Atria – The Millennium Mall\n\n  14 mins drive\n* 🏢\n\n  One World Centre\n\n  650 meters\n\n* 🏭\n\n  Kamala Mills\n\n  700 meters\n* 🌿\n\n  Malabar Hill Elevated Nature Trail\n\n  22 mins drive\n* 🌊\n\n  Marine Drive\n\n  23 mins drive\n* 🛍️\n\n  Phoenix Palladium\n\n  10 mins drive\n* 🌅\n\n  Worli Sea Face\n\n  11 mins drive\n\n### Get Directions & Site Visit\n\nFill the form to unlock exclusive offers & floor plans.\n\nOur Commitment\n\n## We Promise\n\n📞\n\n#### Instant Call Back\n\nOur sales experts are online to assist you immediately.\n\n🚗\n\n#### Free Site Visit\n\nComplimentary pick-up & drop service for site visits.\n\n🏷️\n\n#### Unmatched Price\n\nBest market rates guaranteed directly from the developer.\n\nThe Legacy \n\n## About Lodha Group\n\nLodha Group (Macrotech Developers) is one of India’s leading real estate developers, shaping prime locations across Mumbai, Thane, Pune, and Bengaluru since 1980. Known for landmarks like World Towers, Lodha Park, Palava City, and Trump Tower Mumbai, the brand delivers luxury, premium, and affordable homes with global design standards. Lodha focuses on quality construction, sustainability, and customer trust, backed by strong international investor confidence. With a mission of “Building a Better Life,” the group continues to redefine urban living through world-class engineering and thoughtful community development.\n\n![Lodha Marquise Developer Logo](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/1776339571_Lodha_Group_Logo.png)\n\nClear your Doubts\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nAns: Lodha Marquise is located at Landmark, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400013.\n\nAns: At Lodha Marquise, the starting price of a 3 BHK is ₹ 6.69 Cr.\\*\n\nAns: One of the top developers, Lodha Group, is developing Lodha Marquise, a premium upcoming project.\n\nAns: At Lodha Marquise, you will get spacious 3-BHK and grand 4-bedroom apartments with limited options.\n\nAns: At Lodha Marquise, you will enjoy top world-class amenities like an infinity pool, gymnasium, kids' play area, mini theater, and more, which make your everyday feel like a weekend.\n\nAns: Lodha Marquise is a legally clear and approved project, and the RERA number is P51900001339.\n\nAns: The possessions of Lodha Marquise are scheduled for 2020, as per RERA.\n\n# Home Loan EMI Calculator\n\nPlan your future home with precision. Get instant breakdowns of your monthly payments and interest costs.\n\n₹\n\n₹1 Lakh ₹10 Crore\n\n%\n\n5% 20%\n\nYrs\n\n1 Year 30 Years\n\n## Loan Summary\n\nMonthly EMI ₹0\n\nTotal Interest ₹0\n\nTotal Amount ₹0\n\n### Amortization Schedule\n\n| Year | Opening Balance | Interest Paid | Principal Paid | Closing Balance |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n\n#### Detailed Amortization\n\nView the full year-by-year principal and interest breakdown to plan your repayment strategy.\n\n### Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat is a Home Loan EMI?   \n\nEMI stands for Equated Monthly Installment. It is a fixed amount paid by a borrower to a lender at a specified date each month. EMIs are applied to both interest and principal each month so that over a specified number of years, the loan is paid off in full.\n\n   How is Home Loan EMI calculated?   \n\nThe mathematical formula for calculating EMI is: $E = P \\times r \\times \\frac{(1+r)^n}{(1+r)^n - 1}$, where $E$ is EMI, $P$ is Principal Loan Amount, $r$ is monthly interest rate, and $n$ is loan duration in months.\n\nTransparency & Trust\n\n## MahaRERA Registration\n\n![RERA QR for Lodha Marquise Rera Number](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/lodha-marquise-worli/maharera/1776339571_Lodha_The_Park_Rera_Number_P51900001339.png)\n\n#### Lodha Marquise Rera Number\n\nP51900001339\n\nDetails available on the website [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in) under registered projects.\n\n Luxury Properties Showcase\n\n\n# Luxury Properties\n\nCurated Collections in Worli\n\nAvailable  Worli ![Naman Xana](https://soboxpert.in/images/1780474185_Naman_Xana_Banner_1_3acaab95da.webp)\n\n### Naman Xana\n\nConfig 4, 5 & 6 BHK\n\nStarting At ₹97.50 Cr\\*\n\n\"Naman Xana – Premium Residences by Shree Naman Group\"\n\n[Details](naman-xana.php)   [WhatsApp](https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=919152053999&te